377	    /**
378	     * Assign the owner its household link. The {@link #householdId(Owner) householdId} is computed
379	     * deterministically from the owner's lastName and postcode, so every owner sharing that
380	     * lastName and postcode is assigned the same value automatically, independent of whether the
381	     * owner declares it shares a household. The link is assigned before the
382	     * {@link #checkForConflicts(Owner) conflict checks} because it feeds the owner's
383	     * {@link #householdSize(String) household size} and {@link #membershipLevel(Owner) membership
384	     * level}.
